Package: RegiStat
Type: Package
Title: Offline Bilingual Data Capture and Reproducible Analysis for Clinical
    Registries
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Manuel", "Gutiérrez Rodríguez",
           email = "mgutierrezr_9902@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-8386-5238"))
Description: Free and open-source toolkit for clinical and laboratory
    researchers who need structured data capture and reproducible analysis
    without an internet connection. This development version provides a
    metadata-driven data dictionary with Spanish and English labels, a
    validation engine (required values, types, ranges, allowed choices,
    duplicated identifiers and cross-field rules), and a seeded generator of
    synthetic registry data with known injected errors for testing. Electronic
    case report form capture, a Shiny interface and automated statistical
    reports are planned.
